---
description: No comments in CSS or Vue style blocks; icons stay shadow-free
globs: "**/*.{css,vue}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# CSS and style blocks

- Never add comments in `.css` files or SFC `<style>` blocks (`/* … */` or `//`).
- Do not use CSS comments to explain tokens, media queries, or optical tweaks — keep styles self-explanatory or document in public API comments / markdown outside CSS.
- Decorative and navigation icon SVGs must not use `box-shadow`, `filter`, or `text-shadow`.
